################ 4. Why a self-contained publish rather than a shared net6.0 runtime
No .NET 6 runtime is packaged for Ubuntu 24.04, and the dotnet-install host is refused by this
container's network policy:
$ curl -sSI https://builds.dotnet.microsoft.com/dotnet/Runtime/6.0.36/dotnet-runtime-6.0.36-linux-x64.tar.gz
curl: (56) CONNECT tunnel failed, response 403
exit status: 56
$ apt-cache policy dotnet-runtime-6.0
dotnet-runtime-6.0:
  Installed: (none)
  Candidate: (none)
  Version table:
(empty: not in noble)
api.nuget.org is reachable, so the runtime pack comes from NuGet inside a self-contained publish.
